# 注意：这些一律锚定到根目录。写成 data/ 会匹配任意层级的 data 目录，
# 把 src/main/java/tanktrouble/model/data/ 一起吃掉，别人克隆下来编译不过。
/target/
/dist/
/runtime/
/logs/
/data/
*.log

# IDE project files
.idea/

# Build products belong in GitHub Releases, not in git history: a 58 MB jar committed once
# stays in the history forever and every clone pays for it. The deploy scripts and docs in
# this folder are tracked; only the jars are not.
deploy/server/*.jar
deploy/server/lib/*.jar

# Defence preparation notes - kept locally, not published
docs/答辩可能问题.md

# 视觉头脑风暴临时目录
.superpowers/
